1
00:00:00,022 --> 00:00:03,152
(Penny:)I guess that joke's only funny
in Nebraska.

2
00:00:03,317 --> 00:00:05,777
(Sheldon:)From the data at hand,
you can't draw that conclusion.

3
00:00:05,944 --> 00:00:09,574
(Sheldon:)All you can say with absolute certainty
is that that joke is not funny here.

4
00:00:15,829 --> 00:00:17,369
(Penny:)Boy, it's good to be back.

5
00:00:18,582 --> 00:00:20,712
- How's your family?
- Oh, it was the worst trip.

6
00:00:20,876 --> 00:00:22,836
(Penny:)- Everyone got sick over the weekend.
- Sick?

7
00:00:23,003 --> 00:00:24,673
(Leonard:)Here we go.

8
00:00:27,007 --> 00:00:29,927
- What kind of sick?
- Oh, the flu, I guess.

9
00:00:30,094 --> 00:00:32,174
(Sheldon:)I don't need you to guess,
I need you to know.

10
00:00:32,346 --> 00:00:34,806
(Sheldon:)Now, when did the symptoms
first appear?

11
00:00:34,973 --> 00:00:36,223
(Penny:)Maybe Friday.

12
00:00:36,391 --> 00:00:38,521
(Sheldon:)Friday. Was that morning or afternoon?

13
00:00:39,353 --> 00:00:41,063
(Penny:)- I don't...
- Think, woman.

14
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:43,190
(Sheldon:)Who blew their nose and when?

15
00:00:43,774 --> 00:00:46,024
(Leonard:)Sheldon, relax.
She doesn't have any symptoms.

16
00:00:46,193 --> 00:00:47,733
(Leonard:)I'm sure she's not contagious.

17
00:00:47,903 --> 00:00:49,863
(Sheldon:)Oh, please.

18
00:00:50,739 --> 00:00:53,369
(Sheldon:)If influenza was only contagious
after symptoms appear...

19
00:00:53,534 --> 00:00:55,414
...it would've died out years ago.

20
00:00:55,577 --> 00:00:57,867
(Sheldon:)Somewhere between tool using
and cave painting...

21
00:00:58,038 --> 00:01:01,628
...Homo habilis would've figured out
to kill the guy with the runny nose.

22
00:01:02,209 --> 00:01:05,209
(Leonard:)Penny, you'll have to excuse Sheldon.
He's a bit of a germaphobe.

23
00:01:05,379 --> 00:01:06,589
That's okay. I understand.

24
00:01:06,755 --> 00:01:09,755
(Sheldon:)Thanks for your consideration.
Now please leave.

25
00:01:10,592 --> 00:01:14,142
(Leonard:)You'd better go
before he starts spraying you with Lysol.

26
00:01:14,304 --> 00:01:16,224
(Penny:)Okay, well,
thank you for getting my mail.

27
00:01:16,390 --> 00:01:18,720
(Leonard:)No, problem. Welcome home.

28
00:01:19,226 --> 00:01:20,556
[CAN SPRAYING]

29
00:01:25,399 --> 00:01:28,029
SHELDON:
What?

